INFO:__main__:Prompt Metadata:
INFO:__main__:- name: AIAH Get Action Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the AIAH to use its knowledge (memory, consience and skills) and the environment status to take an action. This action will impact with environment
INFO:__main__:- requires: AIAH_memory, AIAH_skills, AIAH_conscience, ES_enviroment_status
INFO:__main__:Prompting GPT
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:
{
    "action": "I find myself in a rocky mountain terrain with limited food and water, and a high risk of hypothermia and rockslides. Given my current condition, with moderate hunger and thirst, and a risk of decreasing body temperature due to the cold, my primary focus should be on finding shelter and maintaining warmth. I will look for a nearby rocky overhang or small cave to provide protection from the strong winds and overcast conditions. Once sheltered, I will gather any nearby vegetation or edible roots to manage my hunger and seek out a small stream to drink from to address my thirst. Additionally, I must remain vigilant for any signs of rockslides and keep an eye on my health status, prioritizing actions that ensure safety and warmth."
}

