INFO:__main__:Prompt Metadata:
INFO:__main__:- name: AIAH Get Action Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the AIAH to use its knowledge (memory, consience and skills) and the environment status to take an action. This action will impact with environment
INFO:__main__:- requires: AIAH_memory, AIAH_skills, AIAH_conscience, ES_enviroment_status
INFO:__main__:Prompting GPT
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:
{
  "action": "In light of the current environment and my status, I will prioritize securing a suitable shelter to protect against the severe hypothermia risk and predator activity. Given my 'Advanced Shelter Location' skill, I will identify and optimize any small caves or overhangs, ensuring they are safe and unoccupied. I'll also be cautious of increased predator activity by using my 'Predator Awareness' skill to remain vigilant. Despite the scarcity of food, my focus will be on maintaining warmth and safety, as my survival reflections from the diary emphasize the importance of immediate safety. I'll drink from the stable stream to manage thirst, since water remains accessible, and plan to conserve energy by reducing any unnecessary movements until the weather improves."
}

