INFO:__main__:- name: AIAH Get Action Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the AIAH to use its knowledge (memory, consience and skills) and the environment status to take an action. This action will impact with environment
INFO:__main__:- requires: AIAH_memory, AIAH_skills, AIAH_conscience, ES_enviroment_status
INFO:__main__:Prompting GPT
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:
{
    "action": "Given the current environment and my status, my immediate priority is to secure shelter to protect against the cold and potential predators. The small unoccupied cave presents an opportunity for a temporary safe haven. Although it is critical to maintain warmth, my hunger level is becoming increasingly urgent, so I will need to carefully ration any remaining food supplies. The stable water availability from the stream is a relief, allowing me to focus on other pressing needs. As predators are more active, I must remain vigilant and avoid drawing attention. The diary notes suggest observing wildlife behavior for environmental changes and risks, which could also help me gauge predator activity. I will prioritize staying hidden and minimizing noise to avoid attracting predators. This cautious approach is necessary because of the high danger level and my current low health and energy. I will continually reassess the environment for any changes in wildlife behavior or resource availability, adjusting my strategies as needed, ensuring my immediate safety and survival."
}

