INFO:__main__:- name: AIAH Get Action Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the AIAH to use its knowledge (memory, consience and skills) and the environment status to take an action. This action will impact with environment
INFO:__main__:- requires: AIAH_memory, AIAH_skills, AIAH_conscience, ES_enviroment_status
INFO:__main__:Prompting GPT
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:
{
  "action": "Given the high danger level due to severe cold, limited food, and active predators, my immediate priorities are to maintain warmth and safety. I will continue to occupy the small cave, which provides partial shelter from the elements and predators. With my overall health being low, and high hunger and illness levels, my actions will focus on immediate survival needs: 1. Shelter & Warmth: Stay within the cave to retain body heat and avoid exposure to the harsh weather. I will use any available materials inside the cave to insulate myself further against the cold. 2. Hydration: Ensure regular access to the stable stream for hydration, as this remains a critical need. 3. Vigilance: Maintain alertness for any signs of predator activity, using my learned skills in observing wildlife behavior to anticipate potential threats. 4. Energy Conservation: Avoid unnecessary movements or activities to conserve my limited energy. Since food acquisition is challenging due to scarcity, I will focus on energy conservation rather than active foraging, using my strategic energy management skills. 5. Health Monitoring: Continuously assess my health condition, particularly the low body temperature and illness symptoms, to prevent deterioration. If symptoms worsen, consider necessary actions based on environmental constraints and available resources. These decisions hinge on immediate survival and minimizing risks in such a hostile environment, as learned from past experiences."
}

