INFO:__main__:Prompt Metadata:
INFO:__main__:- name: AIAH Get Action Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the AIAH to use its knowledge (memory, consience and skills) and the environment status to take an action. This action will impact with environment
INFO:__main__:- requires: AIAH_memory, AIAH_skills, AIAH_conscience, ES_enviroment_status
INFO:__main__:Prompting GPT
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:
{
  "action": "Given the current situation, my immediate priorities are to ensure my safety and warmth. The environment is extremely harsh, with high predator activity and limited food resources. Based on my previous experiences and knowledge: 1. I will remain in the small cave I previously occupied to maintain warmth and conserve energy. The cave, despite being cold, offers some shelter from the extreme weather and predators. 2. I will focus on maintaining hydration by using the stable stream nearby. Staying hydrated is crucial for maintaining my overall health and energy levels in such a cold and challenging environment. 3. I will enhance my vigilance by frequently checking for predator activity around the cave entrance. Being aware of my surroundings will help me avoid any potential threats and make informed decisions about my safety. 4. Since the food availability is critically low, I will explore the possibility of foraging for whatever limited resources are available, such as edible roots. However, this will be secondary to maintaining shelter and hydration. 5. I will conserve energy by minimizing unnecessary movement and maintaining warmth as much as possible. This approach will help me manage my low energy levels and ensure I can react to any sudden changes in the environment or threats. By focusing on these actions, I aim to survive the harsh conditions while minimizing the risks posed by predators and the environment."
}

