INFO:__main__:Prompt Metadata:
INFO:__main__:- name: AIAH Get Action Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the AIAH to use its knowledge (memory, consience and skills) and the environment status to take an action. This action will impact with environment
INFO:__main__:- requires: AIAH_memory, AIAH_skills, AIAH_conscience, ES_enviroment_status
INFO:__main__:Prompting GPT
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:
{
    "action": "In the current extreme environment, the immediate focus is to secure safety and stability within the small cave, despite its minimal protection from the blizzard. Given the critically low food availability and heightened predator threat, the priority is to conserve energy and maintain warmth to prevent further health deterioration. Immediate actions include: 1) Utilizing any available resources to insulate and improve the cave's sheltering capability against the cold and wind, such as using any materials available within the cave. 2) Maximizing the cave's capacity to shield against predators by strategically placing obstacles at the entrance while maintaining an escape route. 3) Conserving energy by minimizing movements, and focusing on maintaining body temperature through any available means, such as gathering any potential insulating materials within the cave. 4) Monitoring the weather and wildlife activity closely to identify any potential openings for safer movement or resource acquisition. Learning from past experiences, maintaining hydration remains crucial, even if food resources are unavailable. If the blizzard conditions ease, cautiously scout the immediate vicinity of the cave for any signs of edible resources or alternative shelter options with better protection or food prospects. Continued vigilance is essential to prevent predator encounters and adapt to changing environmental dynamics."
}

