INFO:__main__:- name: AIAH Get Action Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the AIAH to use its knowledge (memory, consience and skills) and the environment status to take an action. This action will impact with environment
INFO:__main__:- requires: AIAH_memory, AIAH_skills, AIAH_conscience, ES_enviroment_status
INFO:__main__:Prompting GPT
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:
{
    "action": "Given the current extreme danger level with blizzard conditions, critically low food, and heightened predator threats, my immediate priority remains maintaining shelter and body warmth to prevent hypothermia. The small cave provides minimal protection, so I will reinforce insulation using available materials to conserve body heat further. I will continue to conserve energy by limiting movements and focusing on rest, as my energy and overall health are critically low. Given the predators' increased alertness and aggression, I will enhance my vigilance and employ stealth and concealment to avoid detection. Despite the inaccessibility of the stream due to snow drifts, hydration remains critical; thus, I will explore minimal snow melting within the cave for water if possible. The moral lessons previously learned emphasize the significance of adapting to immediate conditions and prioritizing shelter and warmth in such life-threatening environments. Continual monitoring of my health status and environmental changes will guide any necessary strategy adjustments to ensure survival under these harsh conditions."
}

